1
00:00:44,030 --> 00:00:44,750
You're awake.

2
00:00:49,030 --> 00:00:50,240
Were you

3
00:00:51,030 --> 00:00:52,470
pleased with last night?

4
00:00:55,840 --> 00:00:56,670
Very much so.

5
00:01:04,480 --> 00:01:05,430
Where are you going?

6
00:01:05,510 --> 00:01:06,510
I have a gift for you.

7
00:01:19,920 --> 00:01:21,000
Do you remember

8
00:01:21,120 --> 00:01:22,710
when we first met,

9
00:01:23,510 --> 00:01:25,480
it all began because
of the Immortal Vine?

10
00:01:25,920 --> 00:01:26,790
Of course I remember.

11
00:01:27,480 --> 00:01:28,510
You've made another one?

12
00:01:28,870 --> 00:01:29,950
Now,

13
00:01:30,350 --> 00:01:31,680
my feelings for you

14
00:01:31,870 --> 00:01:33,560
run deeper than I ever imagined.

15
00:01:34,760 --> 00:01:35,790
Whenever I look at you,

16
00:01:36,120 --> 00:01:37,790
my heart fills with joy.

17
00:01:38,560 --> 00:01:39,560
Whenever I'm near you,

18
00:01:40,350 --> 00:01:41,920
I can't help but smile.

19
00:01:42,400 --> 00:01:43,680
When our eyes meet,

20
00:01:43,760 --> 00:01:45,472
they're filled with nothing
but tenderness.

21
00:01:46,350 --> 00:01:48,000
So to me,

22
00:01:48,280 --> 00:01:50,040
this is a truly lucky keepsake.

23
00:01:53,310 --> 00:01:54,280
I embroidered a pair.

24
00:01:54,790 --> 00:01:56,590
One for you, and one for me.

25
00:01:58,400 --> 00:01:59,950
They can be our token

26
00:01:59,968 --> 00:02:01,500
and something to remember each other by.

27
00:02:01,510 --> 00:02:02,688
What do you think?

28
00:02:02,840 --> 00:02:03,640
Of course.

29
00:02:04,230 --> 00:02:05,760
Then I'll keep it on me every day,

30
00:02:05,824 --> 00:02:07,312
and never let it leave my side.

31
00:03:35,620 --> 00:03:36,368
=Blossoms of Power=

32
00:03:36,368 --> 00:03:39,220
(Adapted from the novel, After My
Bloom, All Flowers Wither by Jin Huang)

33
00:03:39,300 --> 00:03:42,260
=Episode 31=

34
00:03:43,424 --> 00:03:45,470
(Taiji Hall)
After the last defeat of the Le tribe,

35
00:03:45,520 --> 00:03:47,088
they finally dropped all pretense.

36
00:03:47,136 --> 00:03:48,960
They have gathered an army
of 3,000,000 and marched against us.

37
00:03:48,960 --> 00:03:51,120
The Northwest Army
is engaged in battle.

38
00:03:53,240 --> 00:03:54,800
Your Majesty,

39
00:03:55,136 --> 00:03:56,870
a dispatch
has just arrived from the front.

40
00:03:56,870 --> 00:03:59,470
The Duke of Wei's
old injuries have yet to heal,

41
00:03:59,470 --> 00:04:01,560
and he has withdrawn
from the front lines.

42
00:04:01,560 --> 00:04:03,080
The battle is at its fiercest.

43
00:04:03,080 --> 00:04:05,470
If he steps down at a time like this,
what are we going to do?

44
00:04:05,470 --> 00:04:06,630
Rest assured, Your Majesty.

45
00:04:06,630 --> 00:04:08,630
The Duke of Wei's command

46
00:04:08,630 --> 00:04:10,520
has been taken over
by Young Master Shen.

47
00:04:10,590 --> 00:04:12,680
It has done nothing to affect morale.

48
00:04:12,680 --> 00:04:15,470
The Northwest Army
is advancing without resistance.

49
00:04:16,040 --> 00:04:17,000
Good.

50
00:04:18,190 --> 00:04:19,190
Good.

51
00:04:20,430 --> 00:04:22,070
Your Majesty.

52
00:04:27,070 --> 00:04:28,270
Excellent.

53
00:04:30,120 --> 00:04:30,920
I had

54
00:04:32,800 --> 00:04:34,600
thought this battle

55
00:04:34,830 --> 00:04:37,270
would surely drag on for a year or more.

56
00:04:37,680 --> 00:04:39,160
At this rate,

57
00:04:39,270 --> 00:04:42,680
I believe it will soon be over.

58
00:04:43,270 --> 00:04:44,040
Good.

59
00:04:44,480 --> 00:04:45,510
Excellent.

60
00:04:50,510 --> 00:04:52,000
Your Majesty's health

61
00:04:52,680 --> 00:04:54,190
has yet to recover.

62
00:04:54,480 --> 00:04:56,430
The medicines
from the Imperial Medical Office

63
00:04:56,750 --> 00:04:58,160
have shown little effect.

64
00:04:58,310 --> 00:05:01,120
Should we summon renowned physicians

65
00:05:01,310 --> 00:05:02,800
to treat Your Majesty?

66
00:05:03,560 --> 00:05:04,270
No.

67
00:05:04,480 --> 00:05:05,630
No medicine

68
00:05:07,270 --> 00:05:09,560
could compare
with today's battle report.

69
00:05:11,870 --> 00:05:13,920
Like father, like son.

70
00:05:15,190 --> 00:05:16,310
Shen Yun'an.

71
00:05:17,480 --> 00:05:18,190
I was

72
00:05:18,750 --> 00:05:20,630
right about you.

73
00:05:21,900 --> 00:05:25,460
(East Palace)

74
00:05:27,680 --> 00:05:29,160
Judging by your expression,

75
00:05:29,160 --> 00:05:30,600
has something good happened?

76
00:05:30,700 --> 00:05:32,390
Xihe, you've come
at just the right time.

77
00:05:32,600 --> 00:05:33,510
Yun'an led the army

78
00:05:33,510 --> 00:05:35,120
and completely crushed
the enemy forces.

79
00:05:35,120 --> 00:05:35,800
Really?

80
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:36,750
Absolutely.

81
00:05:36,920 --> 00:05:37,720
The victory report is right here.

82
00:05:37,720 --> 00:05:38,430
(Young Master Shen Yun'an led the army)

83
00:05:38,430 --> 00:05:39,620
(and crushed the main enemy force.)
The threat along the northern border,

84
00:05:39,620 --> 00:05:40,480
which has plagued Daxing for a century,

85
00:05:40,480 --> 00:05:41,680
has finally been eliminated.

86
00:05:41,920 --> 00:05:43,620
Yun'an lived up
to everyone's expectations

87
00:05:43,632 --> 00:05:45,150
and achieved a truly unparalleled feat.

88
00:05:47,000 --> 00:05:48,120
This is wonderful.

89
00:05:48,400 --> 00:05:50,800
Father's lifelong wish
has finally been fulfilled.

90
00:05:51,750 --> 00:05:52,480
Xihe,

91
00:05:53,120 --> 00:05:54,000
do you know

92
00:05:54,120 --> 00:05:55,120
this great victory

93
00:05:55,120 --> 00:05:56,190
was not won overnight?

94
00:05:56,510 --> 00:05:57,390
Your contribution

95
00:05:57,750 --> 00:05:58,720
was indispensable.

96
00:05:58,920 --> 00:06:00,000
My contribution?

97
00:06:03,430 --> 00:06:04,390
That's right.

98
00:06:04,480 --> 00:06:07,270
Had you not befriended
Consort Shu with sincerity,

99
00:06:07,376 --> 00:06:09,600
understood the hardship
of her marrying far from home,

100
00:06:09,630 --> 00:06:11,600
and even offered help
to her younger brother,

101
00:06:12,040 --> 00:06:13,920
how could Lanhai have
given its full support

102
00:06:13,930 --> 00:06:15,990
at such a critical moment,
sending troops to assist

103
00:06:16,064 --> 00:06:17,840
and pinning down
the northern desert's flank?

104
00:06:18,950 --> 00:06:19,720
Xihe,

105
00:06:20,750 --> 00:06:21,950
you won with people's hearts

106
00:06:22,430 --> 00:06:23,240
and with your wisdom.

107
00:06:23,870 --> 00:06:25,560
You're always praising me,

108
00:06:25,950 --> 00:06:27,360
making me sound perfect.

109
00:06:27,750 --> 00:06:29,390
But you truly are that wonderful.

110
00:06:30,720 --> 00:06:31,830
It's because

111
00:06:31,830 --> 00:06:33,750
you've always believed in me completely

112
00:06:34,070 --> 00:06:36,070
and always stood by my side.

113
00:06:36,920 --> 00:06:37,750
That's why

114
00:06:37,920 --> 00:06:39,920
you are the bedrock on which I stand

115
00:06:40,830 --> 00:06:42,270
and the wind that parts the waves.

116
00:06:49,720 --> 00:06:51,040
Husband and wife are one.

117
00:06:52,630 --> 00:06:54,160
Seeing your talent

118
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:55,720
shine so brightly,

119
00:06:56,920 --> 00:06:57,830
my heart

120
00:06:58,032 --> 00:07:00,016
is filled with nothing
but pride and joy.

121
00:07:00,430 --> 00:07:01,310
Your glory

122
00:07:01,950 --> 00:07:03,120
is my glory.

123
00:07:16,830 --> 00:07:19,240
The Grand Empress Dowager
has been complaining to me.

124
00:07:19,430 --> 00:07:22,510
She said she's held
several banquets lately

125
00:07:22,510 --> 00:07:25,190
and invited every noble lady
in the imperial capital

126
00:07:25,560 --> 00:07:26,830
for you to meet,

127
00:07:27,920 --> 00:07:29,630
yet not a single one caught your eye.

128
00:07:29,720 --> 00:07:32,680
I have let grandmother's
efforts go to waste.

129
00:07:32,830 --> 00:07:33,750
Changying,

130
00:07:37,270 --> 00:07:39,190
tell me the truth.

131
00:07:40,240 --> 00:07:42,630
Just what kind of lady do you like?

132
00:07:43,480 --> 00:07:44,070
Father,

133
00:07:45,310 --> 00:07:46,870
there isn't any woman I like.

134
00:07:47,870 --> 00:07:48,600
I

135
00:07:49,632 --> 00:07:51,830
only wish to return to Anlan
and guard the frontier.

136
00:07:51,830 --> 00:07:53,310
To avoid getting married,

137
00:07:54,310 --> 00:07:55,510
you actually

138
00:07:55,870 --> 00:07:57,070
want to hide away in Anlan?

139
00:07:57,750 --> 00:08:00,040
Is it really that difficult
to find you a wife

140
00:08:00,750 --> 00:08:01,750
who truly suits you?

141
00:08:02,120 --> 00:08:03,000
I believe

142
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:06,120
rather than marrying
a woman I do not love

143
00:08:06,510 --> 00:08:07,870
and ending up an unhappy couple,

144
00:08:08,448 --> 00:08:10,070
I'd rather make the most of my youth,

145
00:08:10,112 --> 00:08:11,240
remain free of attachments,

146
00:08:11,552 --> 00:08:13,240
and devote myself to serving the court.

147
00:08:13,870 --> 00:08:15,000
Starting a family

148
00:08:15,600 --> 00:08:16,510
and building a career

149
00:08:16,800 --> 00:08:18,630
are not mutually exclusive.

150
00:08:19,310 --> 00:08:20,480
To me,

151
00:08:21,190 --> 00:08:22,360
the people of Daxing,

152
00:08:22,870 --> 00:08:23,950
the land of Daxing,

153
00:08:24,176 --> 00:08:25,920
every tree and blade of grass in Daxing,

154
00:08:26,630 --> 00:08:27,630
are the ones

155
00:08:29,240 --> 00:08:30,630
I wish to devote my entire life to.

156
00:08:35,240 --> 00:08:36,080
You really

157
00:08:36,440 --> 00:08:38,480
do have an answer for everything.

158
00:08:40,480 --> 00:08:41,510
I don't believe

159
00:08:42,320 --> 00:08:43,600
there'll never come a day

160
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:46,080
when you understand
matters of the heart.

161
00:08:47,200 --> 00:08:47,750
I'll

162
00:08:48,480 --> 00:08:49,440
be waiting for that day.

163
00:08:49,720 --> 00:08:50,510
Thank you, Father.

164
00:08:57,150 --> 00:08:58,240
Second Young Lady Shen,

165
00:08:58,288 --> 00:08:59,630
you entered the palace today?

166
00:09:00,320 --> 00:09:01,870
The Grand Empress Dowager summoned me.

167
00:09:02,320 --> 00:09:03,630
Was it also about marriage?

168
00:09:06,910 --> 00:09:08,150
I turned it down again.

169
00:09:11,632 --> 00:09:12,670
Where are you going?

170
00:09:13,104 --> 00:09:13,960
I'll take you there.

171
00:09:14,336 --> 00:09:15,328
I promised my friends

172
00:09:15,330 --> 00:09:17,480
I'd meet them at
the poetry society by Qiaozi Crossing.

173
00:09:17,630 --> 00:09:19,120
The Linquan Poetry Society?

174
00:09:19,808 --> 00:09:22,160
How does Your Highness
know about our poetry society?

175
00:09:22,200 --> 00:09:22,976
Your poetry society

176
00:09:23,008 --> 00:09:25,008
is quite well known
throughout the imperial capital.

177
00:09:25,320 --> 00:09:26,840
I heard you admit only ladies.

178
00:09:27,790 --> 00:09:29,870
Besides discussing
literature and poetry,

179
00:09:30,030 --> 00:09:31,630
you also hold flower
arranging gatherings,

180
00:09:31,648 --> 00:09:33,780
equestrian and archery competitions,
and music appreciation events.

181
00:09:33,790 --> 00:09:36,144
Not only do talented noble ladies
come in admiration,

182
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:37,600
even gifted young masters

183
00:09:37,910 --> 00:09:39,030
long to join.

184
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:41,240
Your Highness flatters us.

185
00:09:41,630 --> 00:09:44,030
Our poetry society
has indeed held many gatherings,

186
00:09:44,360 --> 00:09:46,840
and there are many
exceptionally talented noble ladies.

187
00:09:47,360 --> 00:09:48,440
But even

188
00:09:48,720 --> 00:09:50,960
more of them
are ladies with tragic lives.

189
00:09:51,750 --> 00:09:53,670
Some were abandoned by their husbands.

190
00:09:53,960 --> 00:09:55,840
Some were widowed at a young age.

191
00:09:56,200 --> 00:09:58,550
Others were sold
because their families were poor.

192
00:09:58,800 --> 00:10:01,150
They have neither natal families
nor husbands to rely on,

193
00:10:01,910 --> 00:10:03,440
and no skills to earn a living.

194
00:10:04,360 --> 00:10:06,390
It's hard for them
to survive in this world.

195
00:10:07,080 --> 00:10:08,320
But here with me,

196
00:10:08,440 --> 00:10:10,870
they can discover what they excel at.

197
00:10:10,992 --> 00:10:12,816
Then I teach them how to make a living.

198
00:10:13,240 --> 00:10:14,390
One day,

199
00:10:14,550 --> 00:10:16,200
they'll be able to rely on themselves

200
00:10:16,200 --> 00:10:17,670
to build a life in this world,

201
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:19,952
instead of drifting
wherever fate takes them.

202
00:10:20,240 --> 00:10:21,270
Perhaps

203
00:10:21,600 --> 00:10:23,030
a whole new future awaits them.

204
00:10:24,510 --> 00:10:25,480
What you've done

205
00:10:26,480 --> 00:10:27,550
is truly admirable.

206
00:10:29,030 --> 00:10:30,510
That is no small achievement.

207
00:10:31,200 --> 00:10:33,080
Since I've already
decided never to marry,

208
00:10:33,150 --> 00:10:35,960
I won't be tied down by the affairs
of the inner household.

209
00:10:37,270 --> 00:10:38,550
Life is still long.

210
00:10:39,150 --> 00:10:40,510
I ought to do something meaningful

211
00:10:40,912 --> 00:10:43,390
so I can truly live up to
the freedom I fought so hard to win.

212
00:10:50,750 --> 00:10:52,910
Are court affairs
still keeping you busy?

213
00:10:53,630 --> 00:10:54,910
I asked Father

214
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:57,024
to let me return to Anlan
and guard the frontier.

215
00:10:57,630 --> 00:10:59,120
But Father didn't want me so far away.

216
00:10:59,472 --> 00:11:01,720
In the end, he allowed me to serve
in the Imperial Guard.

217
00:11:02,150 --> 00:11:04,150
Your Highness has lofty aspirations.

218
00:11:04,390 --> 00:11:07,200
The ladies at our poetry society
often speak of your reputation.

219
00:11:07,630 --> 00:11:09,200
They all admire you greatly.

220
00:11:09,550 --> 00:11:10,200
What?

221
00:11:10,870 --> 00:11:11,790
Could it be

222
00:11:11,984 --> 00:11:13,510
you're trying to play matchmaker, too?

223
00:11:15,670 --> 00:11:17,200
You don't wish to settle for someone

224
00:11:17,200 --> 00:11:18,840
just to fill the place in your heart.

225
00:11:19,150 --> 00:11:20,510
I couldn't agree more.

226
00:11:20,790 --> 00:11:22,080
Rather than leading someone on,

227
00:11:22,200 --> 00:11:23,390
I'd rather remain on my own.

228
00:11:23,750 --> 00:11:25,440
For my own sake and theirs,

229
00:11:25,440 --> 00:11:26,624
that's the only fair choice.

230
00:11:27,344 --> 00:11:29,984
With just those few words,
you've seen right through me.

231
00:11:30,870 --> 00:11:32,000
Second Young Lady Shen,

232
00:11:32,320 --> 00:11:34,576
that alone is enough for me
to call you a confidante.

233
00:11:51,420 --> 00:11:55,220
(East Palace)

234
00:12:02,120 --> 00:12:02,790
What's wrong?

235
00:12:06,510 --> 00:12:07,080
Mo Yu.

236
00:12:08,120 --> 00:12:08,750
Mo Yu!

237
00:12:08,870 --> 00:12:10,040
Go get Mo Yu at once.

238
00:12:10,040 --> 00:12:10,510
Yes.

239
00:12:10,510 --> 00:12:12,740
(Clarity and Serenity)

240
00:12:15,360 --> 00:12:15,790
Here.

241
00:12:16,400 --> 00:12:17,150
Have some water.

242
00:12:28,030 --> 00:12:28,790
How do you feel?

243
00:12:31,630 --> 00:12:32,510
Just now,

244
00:12:33,000 --> 00:12:34,750
I had a very strange dream.

245
00:12:36,200 --> 00:12:37,080
What kind of dream?

246
00:12:38,120 --> 00:12:39,320
I dreamed

247
00:12:41,150 --> 00:12:42,790
we went to admire the lake.

248
00:12:43,790 --> 00:12:44,870
Then all of a sudden,

249
00:12:44,870 --> 00:12:46,840
a school of colorful carp swam by.

250
00:12:47,600 --> 00:12:49,320
One of them was golden.

251
00:12:50,150 --> 00:12:51,510
It was as if it knew me.

252
00:12:51,510 --> 00:12:53,030
It swam straight toward me.

253
00:12:58,000 --> 00:12:58,790
Your Highness,

254
00:12:59,030 --> 00:13:01,030
the maid on duty
said you weren't feeling well.

255
00:13:01,320 --> 00:13:02,510
I've come to examine you.

256
00:13:02,840 --> 00:13:04,720
I'm all right now. Don't worry.

257
00:13:04,910 --> 00:13:06,270
Since Mo Yu is already here,

258
00:13:07,150 --> 00:13:08,440
let her check your pulse.

259
00:13:08,910 --> 00:13:10,240
That way, I'll be at ease, too.

260
00:13:22,270 --> 00:13:23,480
How is the Crown Princess?

261
00:13:29,030 --> 00:13:30,320
Congratulations, Your Highness.

262
00:13:30,550 --> 00:13:32,480
The Crown Princess is pregnant.

263
00:13:50,570 --> 00:13:52,810
♪A wall that collapses at a single push♪

264
00:13:54,140 --> 00:13:56,390
♪Frost that melts at a single smile♪

265
00:13:57,710 --> 00:14:02,990
♪How can you be this wonderful♪

266
00:14:03,510 --> 00:14:04,390
Xihe,

267
00:14:06,390 --> 00:14:07,510
we're going to have a child.

268
00:14:09,270 --> 00:14:10,440
We're going to have a child.

269
00:14:13,910 --> 00:14:15,030
Mo Yu, tell me quickly.

270
00:14:16,496 --> 00:14:18,660
Crown Princess is suffering
from severe morning sickness.

271
00:14:18,670 --> 00:14:20,670
Is there anything that can help ease it?

272
00:14:20,832 --> 00:14:22,200
Should she be eating something?

273
00:14:22,210 --> 00:14:23,810
I'll have the kitchen
prepare it at once.

274
00:14:23,840 --> 00:14:25,330
Is there anything else she should avoid?

275
00:14:25,344 --> 00:14:26,750
Morning sickness

276
00:14:26,750 --> 00:14:27,910
often causes a poor appetite.

277
00:14:28,080 --> 00:14:30,030
For now, keep her meals light.

278
00:14:30,510 --> 00:14:32,270
The weather is turning cooler.

279
00:14:32,270 --> 00:14:33,540
Be sure she doesn't catch a chill.

280
00:14:33,550 --> 00:14:35,960
If she catches a cold,
she won't be able to take medicine.

281
00:14:36,150 --> 00:14:37,264
For a pregnant lady,

282
00:14:37,264 --> 00:14:38,740
that's the hardest thing to endure.

283
00:14:38,750 --> 00:14:39,600
Light meals.

284
00:14:40,960 --> 00:14:42,080
Don't let her catch a chill.

285
00:14:42,750 --> 00:14:43,390
What else?

286
00:14:44,960 --> 00:14:46,000
Your Highness,

287
00:14:46,048 --> 00:14:48,672
I've been by the Crown Princess's side
since we were children.

288
00:14:48,680 --> 00:14:51,320
I always knew this day would come.

289
00:14:51,670 --> 00:14:52,870
So I've long been prepared.

290
00:14:53,240 --> 00:14:55,320
Please don't worry too much,
Your Highness.

291
00:14:55,720 --> 00:14:57,600
I'll do everything I can

292
00:14:57,696 --> 00:14:59,424
to take good care of the Crown Princess.

293
00:14:59,630 --> 00:15:02,240
I'll go prepare breakfast
for the Crown Princess now.

294
00:15:02,240 --> 00:15:07,520
♪Stepping out of this long game
of hide-and-seek♪

295
00:15:08,270 --> 00:15:09,910
With Mo Yu and Zhen Zhu here,

296
00:15:10,150 --> 00:15:11,120
don't worry.

297
00:15:13,840 --> 00:15:15,000
Of course I know

298
00:15:16,270 --> 00:15:17,750
how devoted they are to you.

299
00:15:19,790 --> 00:15:21,200
But for both of us,

300
00:15:22,630 --> 00:15:24,120
this is our first time,

301
00:15:26,080 --> 00:15:27,790
and it's a matter
of the utmost importance.

302
00:15:28,960 --> 00:15:30,750
No matter how well we've prepared,

303
00:15:32,390 --> 00:15:33,600
it's hard

304
00:15:36,910 --> 00:15:38,000
not to worry.

305
00:16:28,790 --> 00:16:29,480
You're awake.

306
00:16:31,870 --> 00:16:33,120
What time is it?

307
00:16:33,960 --> 00:16:34,870
It's almost Shen hour.

308
00:16:36,750 --> 00:16:38,390
I've been so sleepy lately.

309
00:16:38,840 --> 00:16:40,150
I wake up late in the morning,

310
00:16:40,510 --> 00:16:42,320
and after lunch, I get sleepy again.

311
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:44,910
All I do every day is eat and sleep.

312
00:16:45,600 --> 00:16:47,150
I can't get anything done.

313
00:16:48,320 --> 00:16:49,440
Leave everything else

314
00:16:49,600 --> 00:16:51,390
to Zhen Zhu and Mo Yu.

315
00:16:52,750 --> 00:16:53,750
But there's one thing

316
00:16:55,120 --> 00:16:56,440
only you can do.

317
00:16:57,840 --> 00:16:58,720
What is it?

318
00:16:59,080 --> 00:17:00,360
Go take a walk in the garden.

319
00:17:02,670 --> 00:17:03,200
Let's go.

320
00:17:04,110 --> 00:17:04,680
Wait.

321
00:17:05,790 --> 00:17:06,920
I'll get your outer robe.

322
00:17:27,640 --> 00:17:28,440
Your Highness,

323
00:17:29,536 --> 00:17:31,616
there's something
I'd like to discuss with you.

324
00:17:33,160 --> 00:17:33,750
What is it?

325
00:17:35,200 --> 00:17:36,750
About my pregnancy...

326
00:17:36,760 --> 00:17:39,630
I'd like to wait until after the first
three months before making it public.

327
00:17:39,640 --> 00:17:41,590
Once the pregnancy is stable,

328
00:17:41,920 --> 00:17:43,880
I'll deal with any lurking threats.

329
00:17:45,640 --> 00:17:46,160
All right.

330
00:17:47,960 --> 00:17:50,440
That gives me time
to make some arrangements.

331
00:17:51,000 --> 00:17:52,750
Anything we can prevent in advance,

332
00:17:52,880 --> 00:17:53,720
I'll prepare for it.

333
00:17:54,510 --> 00:17:56,480
You always seem
to have everything under control.

334
00:17:56,790 --> 00:17:58,720
Why are you being so cautious this time?

335
00:17:59,440 --> 00:18:00,550
In this world,

336
00:18:00,550 --> 00:18:02,272
there's no such thing as a perfect plan.

337
00:18:02,480 --> 00:18:03,640
We'll take things as they come

338
00:18:03,750 --> 00:18:05,160
and deal with them accordingly.

339
00:18:08,680 --> 00:18:09,350
Your Highness,

340
00:18:09,590 --> 00:18:10,640
what do you think?

341
00:18:10,830 --> 00:18:12,070
Will our child

342
00:18:12,350 --> 00:18:13,790
be a boy or a girl?

343
00:18:19,400 --> 00:18:20,350
Boy or girl,

344
00:18:21,880 --> 00:18:23,680
our child will be my greatest treasure.

345
00:18:25,750 --> 00:18:27,000
If it's a boy,

346
00:18:27,350 --> 00:18:28,400
I hope

347
00:18:28,550 --> 00:18:31,400
he'll inherit his father's
wisdom and virtue,

348
00:18:32,070 --> 00:18:33,550
and become a great man

349
00:18:33,680 --> 00:18:37,000
who can command the situation with ease,
just like his father.

350
00:18:39,160 --> 00:18:40,440
If it's a girl,

351
00:18:41,310 --> 00:18:42,160
I hope

352
00:18:43,000 --> 00:18:44,790
she'll travel the world,

353
00:18:45,590 --> 00:18:47,110
learn from the greatest minds,

354
00:18:47,350 --> 00:18:48,830
and become a lady

355
00:18:49,070 --> 00:18:50,480
of vision and sound judgment,

356
00:18:51,030 --> 00:18:52,400
just like her mother.

357
00:18:53,880 --> 00:18:55,070
Our child,

358
00:18:55,880 --> 00:18:57,750
born into all the love you have to give,

359
00:18:58,030 --> 00:18:59,480
is destined for greatness

360
00:18:59,640 --> 00:19:00,590
and a glorious future.

361
00:19:08,440 --> 00:19:09,960
I never imagined

362
00:19:11,310 --> 00:19:12,590
that I'd one day

363
00:19:12,880 --> 00:19:14,240
mean so much to you.

364
00:19:17,110 --> 00:19:18,310
The ones we hold dearest

365
00:19:19,400 --> 00:19:20,750
will always matter most.

366
00:19:24,790 --> 00:19:26,000
The ones we hold dearest?

367
00:19:26,830 --> 00:19:28,000
I'm not entirely satisfied.

368
00:19:28,350 --> 00:19:29,680
You have too many dear ones.

369
00:19:30,680 --> 00:19:31,920
I want to be

370
00:19:31,968 --> 00:19:32,976
the one you love most.

371
00:19:33,590 --> 00:19:34,590
Say it again.

372
00:19:35,550 --> 00:19:37,200
You're so shameless.

373
00:19:37,920 --> 00:19:39,920
I've already told you I love you,

374
00:19:40,110 --> 00:19:41,750
and you're still hung up on the wording.

375
00:19:41,960 --> 00:19:43,240
Then you needn't say it.

376
00:19:44,070 --> 00:19:45,216
I'll simply

377
00:19:45,220 --> 00:19:47,290
replace it with
"the one I love most" in my heart.

378
00:19:49,880 --> 00:19:50,960
Back then,

379
00:19:51,110 --> 00:19:53,640
whenever I heard you slip sweet words
into every conversation,

380
00:19:53,650 --> 00:19:55,480
I always thought
you were all smooth talk.

381
00:19:56,070 --> 00:19:57,480
But now,

382
00:19:57,720 --> 00:19:59,070
I actually think

383
00:19:59,070 --> 00:19:59,880
it's rather nice.

384
00:20:09,380 --> 00:20:13,740
(Contemplating the Pine Breeze)

385
00:20:14,240 --> 00:20:14,960
Your Highness,

386
00:20:15,640 --> 00:20:17,240
this medicine is far too potent.

387
00:20:18,128 --> 00:20:19,808
You still need
to recover with great care.

388
00:20:21,480 --> 00:20:22,550
Brooding over things

389
00:20:22,704 --> 00:20:24,320
is most harmful to your health.

390
00:20:27,480 --> 00:20:28,350
Yunhuai,

391
00:20:30,944 --> 00:20:33,030
whenever I think about the day
I'm no longer here,

392
00:20:35,070 --> 00:20:36,750
and Xihe is left to raise our child

393
00:20:37,830 --> 00:20:40,350
while fighting alone
in this den of wolves,

394
00:20:44,480 --> 00:20:45,830
my heart aches unbearably.

395
00:20:57,440 --> 00:20:59,680
Your Highness
has already planned for everything.

396
00:21:00,680 --> 00:21:02,350
Even if that day should ever come,

397
00:21:03,030 --> 00:21:05,830
the Crown Princess
would never be left without support.

398
00:21:10,912 --> 00:21:12,750
The Crown Princess
commands the inner palace.

399
00:21:14,310 --> 00:21:16,030
She has the
Duke of Wei's Manor behind her,

400
00:21:16,680 --> 00:21:20,000
and has won over both Shunan and Lanhai.

401
00:21:20,350 --> 00:21:21,750
With their military support,

402
00:21:23,350 --> 00:21:24,400
and throughout the court,

403
00:21:25,720 --> 00:21:27,110
from the Director of the Secretariat

404
00:21:28,030 --> 00:21:29,270
down to the local officials,

405
00:21:30,160 --> 00:21:31,440
everything has been arranged.

406
00:21:38,550 --> 00:21:39,830
It's just that I can't accept

407
00:21:43,880 --> 00:21:45,790
that I won't be by her side,

408
00:21:47,200 --> 00:21:49,160
or grow old together with her.

409
00:21:52,550 --> 00:21:54,110
For the one you love most,

410
00:21:54,880 --> 00:21:56,000
no matter how much you do,

411
00:21:56,920 --> 00:21:58,200
it never feels like enough.

412
00:22:01,200 --> 00:22:02,030
Yunhuai,

413
00:22:04,440 --> 00:22:05,790
I was once just like you.

414
00:22:06,080 --> 00:22:08,224
My heart belonged
to the mountains and rivers,

415
00:22:08,350 --> 00:22:09,590
and I longed to roam the world.

416
00:22:12,030 --> 00:22:13,510
Until I met her.

417
00:22:15,510 --> 00:22:16,550
For the rest of my life,

418
00:22:18,550 --> 00:22:20,310
I only want to stay by her side.

419
00:22:21,590 --> 00:22:23,240
If there is truly a way

420
00:22:23,750 --> 00:22:25,550
to let me stay with her a little longer,

421
00:22:27,056 --> 00:22:29,392
even if it means enduring the agony
of reforging my body,

422
00:22:29,640 --> 00:22:30,920
through endless hardship,

423
00:22:33,200 --> 00:22:34,510
I am willing to do it.

424
00:22:47,220 --> 00:22:54,060
(Eight years old)

425
00:22:54,060 --> 00:22:56,900
(Ten years old)

426
00:23:43,740 --> 00:23:46,060
(Three years old)

427
00:23:46,060 --> 00:23:48,700
(Four years old)

428
00:23:48,780 --> 00:23:51,020
(Seven years old)

429
00:23:51,020 --> 00:23:53,780
(Eight years old)

430
00:23:53,780 --> 00:23:56,620
(Thirteen years old)

431
00:23:56,620 --> 00:23:59,100
(Fourteen years old)

432
00:23:59,100 --> 00:24:00,300
(Fifteen years old)

433
00:24:13,680 --> 00:24:14,310
Your Highness,

434
00:24:14,790 --> 00:24:16,510
you're reading so many books these days.

435
00:24:19,790 --> 00:24:21,750
These are all for my child.

436
00:24:24,160 --> 00:24:26,900
Whether it's a boy or a girl, they
should study and learn what is right.

437
00:24:26,920 --> 00:24:28,912
From early childhood
enlightenment at the age of one

438
00:24:29,030 --> 00:24:30,790
to the teachings
of the sages at fifteen,

439
00:24:31,240 --> 00:24:32,400
I've already prepared

440
00:24:32,640 --> 00:24:33,790
what they'll read each year.

441
00:24:46,048 --> 00:24:48,176
- Greetings, Your Highness.
- Greetings, Your Highness.

442
00:24:48,310 --> 00:24:48,830
Rise.

443
00:24:49,000 --> 00:24:50,240
May I ask, Your Highness,

444
00:24:50,240 --> 00:24:51,510
why you summoned

445
00:24:51,536 --> 00:24:53,344
the two of us to the palace so urgently?

446
00:24:57,880 --> 00:24:58,550
Zhenghao,

447
00:25:00,310 --> 00:25:01,110
there's something

448
00:25:01,880 --> 00:25:02,830
I'd like to ask of you.

449
00:25:04,240 --> 00:25:05,550
If Your Highness has any orders,

450
00:25:05,550 --> 00:25:07,280
I will carry them out
with all my strength.

451
00:25:07,760 --> 00:25:09,200
There's no need to call it a favor.

452
00:25:09,488 --> 00:25:10,960
You honor me far beyond my station.

453
00:25:10,960 --> 00:25:14,100
You earned your place in the Embroidered
Envoys through the martial examination.

454
00:25:14,112 --> 00:25:14,912
In just two years,

455
00:25:15,072 --> 00:25:16,240
you rose from the lowest rank

456
00:25:16,550 --> 00:25:17,830
to become the Chief Envoy.

457
00:25:17,830 --> 00:25:19,000
In all of Daxing,

458
00:25:19,110 --> 00:25:20,640
you are among the very best.

459
00:25:20,640 --> 00:25:22,480
After the child is born,

460
00:25:22,576 --> 00:25:23,780
whether it's a boy or a girl,

461
00:25:23,790 --> 00:25:24,550
I'd like you

462
00:25:24,656 --> 00:25:26,070
to be their martial arts teacher.

463
00:25:26,200 --> 00:25:27,400
Their martial arts teacher?

464
00:25:27,510 --> 00:25:28,030
Yes.

465
00:25:31,110 --> 00:25:32,830
I've been poisoned since childhood.

466
00:25:32,880 --> 00:25:34,590
Had I not devoted myself
to martial arts,

467
00:25:34,590 --> 00:25:36,080
I would never have survived this long.

468
00:25:36,240 --> 00:25:38,720
I know better than anyone
how important a strong body is.

469
00:25:38,880 --> 00:25:40,270
I hope this child

470
00:25:40,304 --> 00:25:42,096
will not only be able
to protect themselves,

471
00:25:42,160 --> 00:25:44,240
but also have the strength
to protect their mother.

472
00:25:44,240 --> 00:25:45,520
If it's a prince, don't spoil him.

473
00:25:45,530 --> 00:25:47,310
Strict teachers
produce exceptional students.

474
00:25:47,340 --> 00:25:48,656
If he misbehaves, discipline him.

475
00:25:48,672 --> 00:25:49,880
I'll leave it entirely to you.

476
00:25:52,000 --> 00:25:53,030
If it's a princess,

477
00:25:53,350 --> 00:25:54,480
then I'd ask you

478
00:25:55,000 --> 00:25:56,200
to watch over her always

479
00:25:56,590 --> 00:25:57,510
and care for her well.

480
00:25:59,400 --> 00:26:00,480
I accept your command.

481
00:26:00,920 --> 00:26:02,480
I will pass on everything

482
00:26:02,590 --> 00:26:03,720
I've learned in my lifetime

483
00:26:04,350 --> 00:26:05,880
and never fail Your Highness's trust.

484
00:26:07,830 --> 00:26:08,510
Yunhuai,

485
00:26:10,640 --> 00:26:12,160
you've traveled far and wide

486
00:26:12,350 --> 00:26:13,400
and seen much of the world.

487
00:26:13,400 --> 00:26:15,270
Once the child turns five,

488
00:26:15,590 --> 00:26:17,000
alongside their studies,

489
00:26:17,056 --> 00:26:18,750
I'd like you to take them
out of the palace

490
00:26:19,240 --> 00:26:21,240
to see more
of the world's mountains and rivers.

491
00:26:21,312 --> 00:26:22,110
What do you think?

492
00:26:22,110 --> 00:26:23,390
One should read ten thousand books

493
00:26:23,400 --> 00:26:24,590
and travel ten thousand miles.

494
00:26:25,510 --> 00:26:27,720
Let them experience
the lives of the people

495
00:26:28,110 --> 00:26:29,510
and understand their hardships.

496
00:26:30,000 --> 00:26:30,550
Yes.

497
00:26:32,350 --> 00:26:34,550
How can someone
who only sits upon the highest throne,

498
00:26:34,720 --> 00:26:36,440
pampered with every luxury,

499
00:26:36,450 --> 00:26:38,960
ever possess the vision and resolve
to embrace all under heaven?

500
00:26:39,000 --> 00:26:41,400
And how could they possess
true compassion and impartiality?

501
00:26:42,830 --> 00:26:44,400
With you to guide and teach them,

502
00:26:44,550 --> 00:26:45,350
I can rest easy.

503
00:26:50,070 --> 00:26:51,160
I'm counting on you both.

504
00:26:52,560 --> 00:26:54,496
- I accept Your Highness's command.
- I accept Your Highness's command.

505
00:26:54,510 --> 00:26:56,832
- We'll never fail your trust.
- We'll never fail your trust.

506
00:27:07,220 --> 00:27:08,740
(Sixian Hall)

507
00:27:13,240 --> 00:27:14,030
Your Highness.

508
00:27:19,270 --> 00:27:20,790
I've summoned you here today

509
00:27:21,200 --> 00:27:23,160
to announce something important.

510
00:27:24,920 --> 00:27:25,960
At last,

511
00:27:26,350 --> 00:27:28,080
I've freed you from your servant status.

512
00:27:31,240 --> 00:27:32,310
Your Highness,

513
00:27:33,000 --> 00:27:34,070
do you mean...

514
00:27:34,112 --> 00:27:36,032
Ever since I took charge
of the Six Palaces,

515
00:27:36,070 --> 00:27:37,750
I've been planning this.

516
00:27:39,110 --> 00:27:40,200
These are your papers.

517
00:27:40,790 --> 00:27:41,510
Keep them safe.

518
00:27:44,550 --> 00:27:45,640
From this day forward,

519
00:27:45,808 --> 00:27:48,420
(Mo Yu is registered as a commoner)
you are no longer servants.

520
00:27:48,440 --> 00:27:50,990
(Eligible for appointment as a Fifth-Rank Palace Matron)
You have also been made fifth-rank palace officials.

521
00:27:51,000 --> 00:27:52,510
Even after you marry,

522
00:27:52,510 --> 00:27:54,310
you may continue serving in the palace.

523
00:27:55,936 --> 00:27:57,790
- Thank you for Your Highness's grace.
- Thank you for Your Highness's grace.

524
00:27:57,790 --> 00:27:58,480
Get up.

525
00:27:59,720 --> 00:28:00,750
All these years,

526
00:28:01,030 --> 00:28:02,720
you've always stayed by my side.

527
00:28:03,550 --> 00:28:04,960
Everything you've done for me,

528
00:28:05,160 --> 00:28:06,310
I've kept in my heart.

529
00:28:06,400 --> 00:28:08,590
I've long since thought of you
as my younger sisters.

530
00:28:14,400 --> 00:28:15,480
From this day forward,

531
00:28:16,110 --> 00:28:18,160
you'll have more choices.

532
00:28:19,270 --> 00:28:20,480
If one day

533
00:28:20,680 --> 00:28:22,110
you meet a man you truly love,

534
00:28:22,310 --> 00:28:23,400
just tell me.

535
00:28:24,240 --> 00:28:25,310
I'll prepare

536
00:28:25,310 --> 00:28:26,960
a generous dowry for you,

537
00:28:27,200 --> 00:28:28,920
and marry you off in grand style,

538
00:28:29,110 --> 00:28:31,400
with all the honors due a noble lady.

539
00:28:31,680 --> 00:28:34,310
If your ambition
lies in official service,

540
00:28:34,400 --> 00:28:36,640
and you wish to pursue
a career as a palace official,

541
00:28:37,072 --> 00:28:38,270
I'll support you as well.

542
00:28:39,310 --> 00:28:41,200
Rely on your own abilities

543
00:28:41,640 --> 00:28:43,720
to make a name for yourselves
in the palace.

544
00:28:44,030 --> 00:28:45,160
For the rest of my life,

545
00:28:45,160 --> 00:28:46,550
I only wish to remain by your side.

546
00:28:46,624 --> 00:28:48,720
Your Highness has reached
the third month of your pregnancy.

547
00:28:48,720 --> 00:28:50,590
This is when you
need people around you most.

548
00:28:51,030 --> 00:28:52,070
Zhen Zhu and I

549
00:28:52,200 --> 00:28:53,680
won't leave your side.

550
00:28:53,680 --> 00:28:56,030
From now on, leave the palace affairs
to Mo Yu and me.

551
00:28:56,310 --> 00:28:58,830
You and His Highness
can tend the flowers,

552
00:28:58,830 --> 00:28:59,830
make tea and paint,

553
00:28:59,920 --> 00:29:01,920
play the qin, compose music,
play chess,

554
00:29:01,920 --> 00:29:04,080
and talk about the little prince
and little princess.

555
00:29:04,240 --> 00:29:05,720
Please don't send us away.

556
00:29:07,590 --> 00:29:09,070
No one's sending you away.

557
00:29:09,880 --> 00:29:11,070
If you

558
00:29:11,070 --> 00:29:12,720
wish to remain by my side,

559
00:29:13,680 --> 00:29:14,790
then stay here.

560
00:29:16,000 --> 00:29:17,440
But these papers

561
00:29:17,790 --> 00:29:18,880
must be kept safe.

562
00:29:19,920 --> 00:29:21,000
They represent

563
00:29:21,240 --> 00:29:23,590
a future where you will no longer
be bound by your status.

564
00:29:24,510 --> 00:29:26,000
Whatever path you choose,

565
00:29:26,448 --> 00:29:28,030
you'll be able to hold your head high

566
00:29:28,030 --> 00:29:29,230
and live with greater dignity.

567
00:30:36,720 --> 00:30:39,000
I came especially to visit you,
Brother-in-law.

568
00:30:39,360 --> 00:30:41,584
As luck would have it,
you were practicing your sword.

569
00:30:41,590 --> 00:30:42,590
I told you before

570
00:30:44,160 --> 00:30:45,510
not to come to my manor again.

571
00:30:48,790 --> 00:30:51,310
You haven't been to court
these past few days.

572
00:30:51,720 --> 00:30:53,720
I came to bring you some news.

573
00:30:56,350 --> 00:30:57,350
The East Palace

574
00:30:57,750 --> 00:31:00,830
has informed His Majesty and
Grand Empress Dowager of the good news.

575
00:31:01,440 --> 00:31:02,590
The Crown Princess

576
00:31:04,400 --> 00:31:05,400
is expecting.

577
00:31:22,240 --> 00:31:23,880
On my way here,

578
00:31:24,920 --> 00:31:25,550
just imagining

579
00:31:25,550 --> 00:31:27,590
the look on your face
when you heard the news

580
00:31:27,590 --> 00:31:29,070
got my blood racing.

581
00:31:29,680 --> 00:31:31,240
You really didn't disappoint me.

582
00:31:42,480 --> 00:31:44,400
Admit it, Changqing.

583
00:31:47,590 --> 00:31:49,200
You and I are the same.

584
00:31:50,030 --> 00:31:51,550
When we want something,

585
00:31:52,480 --> 00:31:54,270
we'll stop at nothing to get it.

586
00:31:56,830 --> 00:31:58,350
The difference between us

587
00:31:59,310 --> 00:32:00,750
is that if I can't have it,

588
00:32:02,160 --> 00:32:03,590
I'll destroy it.

589
00:32:05,720 --> 00:32:06,590
Changqing.

590
00:32:06,720 --> 00:32:07,880
You can't bear to do it.

591
00:32:08,440 --> 00:32:09,720
Do you want me to help you?

592
00:32:19,440 --> 00:32:20,750
Touch her if you dare.

593
00:32:22,720 --> 00:32:24,110
The more you care,

594
00:32:25,160 --> 00:32:26,960
the more excited I become.

595
00:33:28,432 --> 00:33:29,720
Please forgive me, Prince Xin.

596
00:33:29,720 --> 00:33:30,590
I deserve to die.

597
00:33:30,680 --> 00:33:31,830
I didn't mean it.

598
00:33:32,160 --> 00:33:33,270
Why did the incense break?

599
00:33:35,830 --> 00:33:36,550
Speak!

600
00:33:36,816 --> 00:33:37,968
Why did the incense break?

601
00:33:37,970 --> 00:33:39,270
Please calm your anger, Prince Xin.

602
00:33:39,270 --> 00:33:41,150
If the incense broke,
simply light another stick.

603
00:33:41,160 --> 00:33:42,920
Why let it upset you
and harm your health?

604
00:33:42,976 --> 00:33:44,592
If Her Highness knows in the afterlife,

605
00:33:44,680 --> 00:33:45,830
she'll be distressed as well.

606
00:33:52,790 --> 00:33:53,880
The incense broke

607
00:33:56,480 --> 00:33:58,110
to tell Qingzhi

608
00:33:58,448 --> 00:34:00,300
that our bond in this life
has come to an end,

609
00:34:00,310 --> 00:34:02,144
and we shall
never meet again in the next.

610
00:34:03,790 --> 00:34:04,790
Its breaking

611
00:34:06,790 --> 00:34:08,480
means Qingzhi and I

612
00:34:11,320 --> 00:34:12,800
are to be parted forever.

613
00:34:16,590 --> 00:34:17,630
Replace it!

614
00:34:18,510 --> 00:34:19,070
Yes.

615
00:34:28,380 --> 00:34:34,060
(The Late Lady Gu)

616
00:34:42,710 --> 00:34:43,760
Qingqing,

617
00:34:44,590 --> 00:34:45,670
from that day on,

618
00:34:47,230 --> 00:34:48,440
I replaced this incense

619
00:34:49,550 --> 00:34:51,360
with agarwood that never breaks.

620
00:34:51,550 --> 00:34:52,880
Lifetime after lifetime,

621
00:34:54,510 --> 00:34:55,800
we'll be together forever.

622
00:34:59,920 --> 00:35:01,710
You will always be my wife.

623
00:35:25,190 --> 00:35:26,550
Yunhuai.

624
00:35:27,280 --> 00:35:27,920
Your Highness.

625
00:35:30,960 --> 00:35:32,230
Tell me the truth.

626
00:35:37,230 --> 00:35:39,710
Am I already beyond cure?

627
00:35:41,320 --> 00:35:42,510
Your Highness,

628
00:35:44,480 --> 00:35:46,030
the strange poison has flared up again.

629
00:35:47,280 --> 00:35:48,480
It has penetrated your bones.

630
00:35:49,590 --> 00:35:50,510
All three meridians

631
00:35:51,710 --> 00:35:52,960
have already been corrupted.

632
00:35:54,840 --> 00:35:56,000
There's no reversing it.

633
00:36:00,440 --> 00:36:02,590
Does that mean I could...

634
00:36:13,030 --> 00:36:14,510
Please forgive my incompetence.

635
00:36:26,360 --> 00:36:28,360
I know you still have one medicine

636
00:36:32,320 --> 00:36:35,550
that can let me live like
an ordinary man for a few more days.

637
00:36:36,880 --> 00:36:37,480
You mustn't.

638
00:36:39,320 --> 00:36:40,800
That medicine is extremely dangerous.

639
00:36:42,150 --> 00:36:43,280
Once the floodgates burst,

640
00:36:43,280 --> 00:36:44,510
there will be no turning back.

641
00:36:47,480 --> 00:36:48,840
Go and bring it to me.

642
00:36:49,000 --> 00:36:49,630
Your Highness.

643
00:36:54,400 --> 00:36:56,230
Xihe is with child.

644
00:36:57,840 --> 00:37:00,110
I want to be with them as best I can.

645
00:37:33,760 --> 00:37:35,400
What are you thinking about?

646
00:37:40,590 --> 00:37:41,630
I was thinking...

647
00:37:42,400 --> 00:37:44,320
Even knowing my life hangs by a thread,

648
00:37:46,230 --> 00:37:48,190
I still can't bear to let you go.

649
00:37:51,510 --> 00:37:52,320
I owe you

650
00:37:54,000 --> 00:37:55,670
far too much.

651
00:37:59,510 --> 00:38:01,110
I chose you as my husband

652
00:38:01,110 --> 00:38:02,864
because you
wouldn't live long, remember?

653
00:38:03,550 --> 00:38:04,760
The two of us

654
00:38:04,760 --> 00:38:07,000
are perfectly matched.

655
00:38:07,190 --> 00:38:08,280
We each got what we wanted.

656
00:38:15,280 --> 00:38:16,150
Besides,

657
00:38:17,440 --> 00:38:18,840
I never intended to remarry.

658
00:38:19,880 --> 00:38:21,320
In my lifetime,

659
00:38:22,030 --> 00:38:23,360
I will have only one husband.

660
00:38:35,230 --> 00:38:38,000
Youyou and Luming.

661
00:38:38,230 --> 00:38:41,360
A match made in heaven.

662
00:38:57,440 --> 00:38:59,150
Has the baby
been giving you trouble today?

663
00:39:02,550 --> 00:39:04,360
I think the baby just kicked me.

664
00:39:04,880 --> 00:39:06,230
Silly.

665
00:39:06,230 --> 00:39:08,150
The baby's so tiny. How could it kick?

666
00:39:12,000 --> 00:39:12,960
Little Goldfish,

667
00:39:13,440 --> 00:39:15,070
be good to your mother.

668
00:39:15,280 --> 00:39:16,590
Don't be so naughty.

669
00:39:17,000 --> 00:39:18,550
What if you hurt your mother?

670
00:39:19,480 --> 00:39:20,550
Little Goldfish?

671
00:39:22,800 --> 00:39:24,710
That's the nickname
I've chosen for our child.

672
00:39:25,536 --> 00:39:26,760
Whether it's a boy or a girl.

673
00:39:34,976 --> 00:39:36,480
I've already picked a given name.

674
00:39:37,880 --> 00:39:38,760
Xiao Junshu.

675
00:39:39,400 --> 00:39:40,510
Junshu?

676
00:39:42,150 --> 00:39:43,840
The name Junshu

677
00:39:43,840 --> 00:39:45,510
symbolizes one who governs the realm.

678
00:39:45,920 --> 00:39:47,320
That's too weighty.

679
00:39:47,550 --> 00:39:49,030
Will Father approve?

680
00:39:49,440 --> 00:39:50,550
Our child's name

681
00:39:50,960 --> 00:39:52,920
is for you and me alone to decide.

682
00:39:58,360 --> 00:39:59,070
Trust me.

683
00:39:59,710 --> 00:40:00,670
He'll agree.

684
00:40:05,150 --> 00:40:06,000
I trust you.

685
00:40:19,500 --> 00:40:26,060
(The Grave of My Wife, Li Yanhui.
Husband, Xiao Changtai)

686
00:40:34,630 --> 00:40:35,480
Changtai,

687
00:40:36,710 --> 00:40:38,000
are you really going?

688
00:40:43,510 --> 00:40:44,710
From the very beginning,

689
00:40:46,110 --> 00:40:48,110
he never saw me as his own son.

690
00:40:50,030 --> 00:40:51,190
My future,

691
00:40:52,070 --> 00:40:53,110
my love,

692
00:40:53,550 --> 00:40:54,630
my wife,

693
00:40:56,030 --> 00:40:58,400
he destroyed them all.

694
00:40:58,544 --> 00:41:00,400
Now that I've reached
the end of the road,

695
00:41:02,230 --> 00:41:04,630
I have nothing left to fear.

696
00:41:05,664 --> 00:41:07,840
Once you take this path,
there's no turning back.

697
00:41:08,816 --> 00:41:10,960
If you stop now, change your name,
and disappear,

698
00:41:11,320 --> 00:41:13,280
you might still live out
the rest of your days.

699
00:41:16,840 --> 00:41:17,960
Without you,

700
00:41:19,960 --> 00:41:21,630
what life would I have left?

701
00:41:21,780 --> 00:41:24,260
(The Grave of My Wife, Li Yanhui.
Husband, Xiao Changtai)

702
00:41:24,280 --> 00:41:25,880
I will make him regret

703
00:41:27,110 --> 00:41:29,440
looking down on me,

704
00:41:31,030 --> 00:41:32,230
and using me all these years.

705
00:41:47,920 --> 00:41:49,480
Now that you know the truth,

706
00:41:50,030 --> 00:41:51,400
why do you still try to stop me?

707
00:41:54,230 --> 00:41:55,920
Xihe,

708
00:41:56,110 --> 00:41:59,230
I'm sorry for barging into

709
00:41:59,400 --> 00:42:00,480
your life.

710
00:42:00,760 --> 00:42:02,070
I only hope

711
00:42:02,320 --> 00:42:05,030
you'll never regret marrying me...

712
00:42:09,510 --> 00:42:12,450
♪I've hidden so many words♪

713
00:42:13,070 --> 00:42:15,870
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

714
00:42:16,740 --> 00:42:23,710
♪So never uncover♪

715
00:42:23,900 --> 00:42:26,260
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

716
00:42:27,390 --> 00:42:30,120
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

717
00:42:31,080 --> 00:42:36,420
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

718
00:42:38,180 --> 00:42:41,000
♪Every answer I gave♪

719
00:42:41,800 --> 00:42:44,650
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

720
00:42:45,440 --> 00:42:48,810
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

721
00:42:49,070 --> 00:42:52,380
♪How hard it truly was?♪

722
00:42:55,350 --> 00:42:58,790
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

723
00:42:59,780 --> 00:43:02,110
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

724
00:43:03,380 --> 00:43:09,140
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

725
00:43:10,550 --> 00:43:13,680
♪It's a shame I never could♪

726
00:43:14,130 --> 00:43:17,140
♪Give you a moon in return♪

727
00:43:17,250 --> 00:43:23,890
♪With the same open heart you loved me♪

728
00:43:23,890 --> 00:43:27,560
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

729
00:43:28,430 --> 00:43:31,190
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

730
00:43:31,630 --> 00:43:34,760
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

731
00:43:35,200 --> 00:43:41,150
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

732
00:43:42,550 --> 00:43:46,100
♪You'll never♪

733
00:43:46,380 --> 00:43:55,850
♪Know how much I long to, long to♪

734
00:44:22,020 --> 00:44:25,500
(No animals were harmed
in the making of this film)
